# One More Run — visual

Full source of truth: `docs/visual-bible.md`.

## Never change (unless the user explicitly asks)

Physics, hitboxes, speed curve, collision, reachability, SAFE/RISK/DUAL rewards, streak/multiplier math, Coin value/persistence, VariationDirector cadence, Yandex lifecycle.

## Visual identity

Light handmade garden **corridor**, not a fantasy forest and not neon.

Hero is **Loaf**: one master cat. Big head, no neck, stub legs, **soft folded right ear**, **left head patch**, **central fluffy plume tail**. Skins are recolours of Loaf, not new anatomy.

## Tokens only

SkyPaper `#F3E4C7`, FloorSand `#E2C992`, HedgeSage `#6F9A5E`, PlanterWood `#C4A06A`, CatCream `#F6E7C8`, CatGinger `#E39A4F`, SafeLawn `#A8C98B`, RiskApricot `#E0A36A`, HighRiskClay `#C45C32`, CoinAmber `#E8B84A`, InkBrown `#4A3428`, ShadowDust `#C4A97A`.

Do not add hues. Dark skins still use InkBrown outlines.

## Line / light / shape

- Outline 4px InkBrown. Shadow +5,+5 ShadowDust. One sun, no bloom.
- Radii: 0 (gates) or 12px (cat, coins, plates). Gates stay rectangles.
- SAFE = wider calm wood + `+10`; RISK = tighter apricot gate + `+100`; HIGH RISK = narrower clay + `+250`. No full-path colour fills. No permanent SAFE/RISK words during play. No lava/spikes/skulls.

## Assets

Procedural: track, gates, fills, HUD, particles, coins-as-circles. External: Loaf sprites, optional felt tile, icon/cover **from Loaf**.

Do not drop unedited AI images into production. No second marketing cat. No emoji. No new cosmetics in code until the overhaul order in the bible.

## Check

After visual edits: readable at phone size and at high speed; Loaf still matches icon rules; `npm run check` if gameplay files were touched (they should not be).
